                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-[#0090d0] rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0"></span> Reactive intermediate trapping (GSH, CN) and covalent binding (microsomes, hepatocytes)</li>
